QNX change from QNX's aports (core/binutils/0009.patch).

Taken from qnx-ports/aports core/binutils -- the APKBUILD the QNX Everywhere 8.0.4r1
image's package is built from.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

From 7f3d33967ea5e651bfc3df4541789e6f7dab0c2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shivam Saxena <shisaxena@blackberry.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Sep 2024 14:44:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qnx: re-sync with svn

re-syncing the qnx/main branch to the latest in svn.

CLT-9242
---
diff --git a/ld/emultempl/nto.em b/ld/emultempl/nto.em
index c577e0f33f9..2c726e5a814 100644
--- a/ld/emultempl/nto.em
+++ b/ld/emultempl/nto.em
@@ -170,7 +170,7 @@ nto_add_note_section (void) {
   /* Update QNX stack note content.  */
   h_size = note_sec->size - sizeof(struct nto_stack_note);
   n_note = (struct nto_stack_note *) (note_sec->contents + h_size);
-  is_update = note_sec->owner != stub_file->the_bfd;
+  is_update = stub_file && (note_sec->owner != stub_file->the_bfd);
 
   if (link_info.stacksize > 0)
     bfd_h_put_32 (note_sec->owner, link_info.stacksize, &n_note->stacksize);

